handoff/DECIDED.md:742:- otp.resend-failed: F2 — Preserve code; retry if eligible; do not claim new code sent — *Source: Feedback state map: otp.resend-failed*
handoff/DECIDED.md:761:### otp-28 · What does the app show in otp.expired-and-resend-limited, and how does it recover?
handoff/DECIDED.md:763:- otp.expired-and-resend-limited: W1 — Locked treatment (D-46): empty disabled boxes, keyboard closed, Verify disabled, no consent, no resend line. Copy: "This code has expired. Request a new code in 9:42, or call Doctor Ops." — *Source: Feedback state map: otp.expired-and-resend-limited*
handoff/DECIDED.md:770:- [MOCK] 10 min in the prototype. Keep configurable (a server or config value, never typed into a screen); not a production promise. Note: OQ-017: how long a code stays valid. — *Source: Prototype setting [MOCK]*
handoff/DECIDED.md:777:- [MOCK] 15 min in the prototype. Keep configurable (a server or config value, never typed into a screen); not a production promise. Note: OQ-017: lock after 5 wrong codes. — *Source: Prototype setting [MOCK]*
handoff/DECIDED.md:782:### otp-31 · What is the value of "resendWaits"?
handoff/DECIDED.md:784:- [MOCK] 30 s → 60 s → 120 s in the prototype. Keep configurable (a server or config value, never typed into a screen); not a production promise. Note: OQ-017: waits between resends. — *Source: Prototype setting [MOCK]*
handoff/DECIDED.md:798:- 4. Agreed rule (D-35: first code + 3 resends per number per window). Read it from configuration; copy reads the value, never a typed number. — *Source: Setting (agreed rule)*
handoff/DECIDED.md:1110:- **Set availability:** quick picks 15 / 30 / 45 min, 1 / 2 / 3 hours, plus the wheel (hours and minutes, 15-minute steps). Minimum **15 minutes**, any start time, no maximum (24/7). Confirm starts the countdown. — *Source: App logic §3.*
handoff/DECIDED.md:1131:- **Add time:** shown when time is running low (near expiry, `[MOCK]` 5 min); same picker in a sheet; "Time added" toast. An error in the add-time sheet sits 16 above its button, as on the page. — *Source: App logic §3.*
handoff/DECIDED.md:1313:- home.stop-pending: N1 + L1 — Finish request/assigned case before stop. Subtitle "You won't get new cases." (not a repeat of the notice). **No "Time remaining" row**; quiet "Ending…" without spinner (D-47) — *Source: Feedback state map: home.stop-pending*
handoff/DECIDED.md:1334:- [MOCK] 5 min in the prototype. Keep configurable (a server or config value, never typed into a screen); not a production promise. Note: app-logic §3 near-expiry. — *Source: Prototype setting [MOCK]*
handoff/DECIDED.md:1341:- 15 min. Agreed rule (app-logic §3). Read it from configuration; copy reads the value, never a typed number. — *Source: Setting (agreed rule)*
handoff/DECIDED.md:1348:- 15 min. Agreed rule (app-logic §3 (15-min wheel)). Read it from configuration; copy reads the value, never a typed number. — *Source: Setting (agreed rule)*
