2086:- ✅ **Flag 6 — answered:** the case does go back to the queue, but the doctor is not told — no queue line anywhere. **Updated D-83:** the case goes on hold and the system retries it by hangup cause; nothing goes to Ops. — *Source: App logic §7.*
