handoff/AGENTS.md:44:Every size, colour and word comes from `tokens` or `messages`, including border widths (`tokens.borderWidth.default`), the focus ring (`tokens.focusRing.width` / `.offset`), icon and spinner sizes (`tokens.iconSize.*`, `tokens.spinner.size` / `.ring`), the logo width (`tokens.logoLockup.width`), the `+91` prefix (`messages['signin.phonePrefix']`) and the logo's accessible name (`messages['signin.logoAlt']`). **Never create a constants file of numbers or strings.** If you need a value that has neither, it's a question, not a constant.
handoff/AGENTS.md:49:- Motion: the web types its animation times (`timing: true`); use `tokens.duration.*` instead — the busy spinner turns once every `tokens.duration.spinner` (800 ms) and stops under the phone's reduce-motion setting (DECIDED o24). Don't type a time.
